      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also think that there should be a delay between when tracking is lost and the hands/arms resetting. Often have I lost tracking for less than a second and have my arms teleport to my sides only to come back instantly again. A short delay of 1 second or so between loosing tracking and your hands resetting would be very welcome.",
